@startuml 协作图_模型训练与评估
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 50

rectangle ":System" as System
rectangle ":AnnotationManager" as AnnotationManager
rectangle ":ModelManager" as ModelManager
rectangle ":SVMModel" as SVMModel
rectangle ":TrainingThread" as TrainingThread
rectangle ":UIManager" as UIManager

System -down-> AnnotationManager : 1:getLabeledData()
AnnotationManager -down-> System : 1.1:labeledDataSet
System -right-> ModelManager : 2:validateParameters(params)
ModelManager -down-> System : 2.1:parametersValid=true
System -down-> ModelManager : 3:createSVMModel()
ModelManager -down-> SVMModel : 3.1:newInstance()
SVMModel -down-> ModelManager : 3.2:modelCreated
System -right-> TrainingThread : 4:start()
TrainingThread -down-> SVMModel : 5:extractFeatures(dataSet)
SVMModel -down-> TrainingThread : 5.1:featuresExtracted
TrainingThread -down-> SVMModel : 6:trainSVM()
SVMModel -down-> TrainingThread : 6.1:trainingComplete
TrainingThread -up-> System : 7:updateProgress(progress)
System -down-> UIManager : 7.1:displayTrainingProgress()
TrainingThread -right-> SVMModel : 8:saveModelFile()
SVMModel -up-> TrainingThread : 8.1:saved
TrainingThread -up-> System : 9:trainingFinished
System -right-> ModelManager : 10:evaluateModel()
ModelManager -down-> SVMModel : 10.1:generateEvaluationMetrics()
SVMModel -up-> ModelManager : 10.2:evaluationMetrics
ModelManager -up-> System : 11:generateEvaluationReport()
System -right-> UIManager : 12:displayEvaluationMetrics()

legend right
  图 5 模型训练与评估协作图
endlegend

@enduml